            "notes": "## Powers\n\n[Cyclone](item_197843aa-de82-4387-b6c9-e5e1549b4832) is great, you can shoot out two rightclicks instantly and it one shots a lot of heroes. You can flank with this too and you can \"cancel\" the height by standing inside rooms.\n\n## Items\n\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) and [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) are pretty basic. Attack speed is not very noticeable. [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318) can be played instead of [Ballistic Buffer](item_40146dd3-a8cb-40ca-8917-c430bfa2be0e) but I don\u2019t usually like it. [Running Shoes](item_950eccea-31a0-4a55-8c2a-75bf7920e1aa) is good if there aren\u2019t many long-range or hitscan heroes.",
