            "notes": "### Powers\n\n[Seekerpoint](item_7174fb2f-38d3-48d4-8705-5d90ac72876e) shoots 6 bolts if you hit with [Cyclone](item_197843aa-de82-4387-b6c9-e5e1549b4832) and will be very useful later on with [Redux](item_e27dc8d9-4fa9-4e55-bf9a-7a4b3532a0d8). This helps confirm kills when you hit people twice. It takes a bit of time to fire however.\n\n## Items\n\n[Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) is always nice on Freja, and I already talked about [Slipstream Scarf](item_df2483b0-8907-42e6-bca9-74c000d335a3). 15% WP round over round is very strong and our goal.",
