            "notes": "## Items\n\nAnother very straightforward round: [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is great because it allows us to keep the slot for a green HP item.\n\nAn alternative to [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) is [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448). You will almost always have 1\u20132 stacks of this active, and 10% CDR is very nice.\n\nFor poorer rounds, you can replace [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) or another green item with [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).",
