            "notes": "## Powers\n\nThis round is where you get your CDR from [Redux](item_e27dc8d9-4fa9-4e55-bf9a-7a4b3532a0d8). It works great with [Seekerpoint](item_7174fb2f-38d3-48d4-8705-5d90ac72876e), and you also have 10% CDR from [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) (or [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f)).\n\n## Items\n\nIn most rounds I take [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) because we still have a good amount of HP.  \n\nFor poorer rounds, again [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27).",
