            "notes": "## Items\n\nThis round we get [Vanadium Injection](item_57953fbc-11ff-4e92-9928-fc59b7be668f). This item is very powerful on Freja because she gets ult very fast, especially this late into the game. You should try to not ult as much as possible. Your ult is pretty bad and theres Kirikos in every game.\n\nIf you are ahead and aren't under press, just can grab more damage with [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce), [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) and rare items.",
