            "notes": "## Powers\n\nThe last powers are either [Seismic Shot](item_546ce14f-0a36-46a1-9dff-dae2d0935f8e) or [Deep Pockets](item_4e5d5d1d-2c0d-4f5e-9521-9f71bdb88e9e). They are both about the same.\n\n## Items\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is nice with the overhealth, and [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) is the cheapest damage you can get.\n\nIf you have more money, you can run [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce), but I don't find this super good on Freja because you don't headshot that often. It provides more damage than [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) or [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27) if you have the money for it.\n\n[Overdrive Core](item_a2a8dba1-5f2f-4da1-9445-b08f49162121) is very good late game because there's so much burst going around.\n\nIf you are super stacked, you can take [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) over [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) because it provides 25 HP.",
